 17	// ALLY-001: a dangling membership is a users.alliance_id the host holds no alliance_members row for.
 18	// leaveAlliance refuses to remove it ("Member not found"), and the apply half skips the account as
 19	// already engaged, which is how the lane the scorecard's alliance aspect measures stayed at zero for
 20	// a week. The pass releases the pointer, and — for a membership it could really remove — the freed
 21	// account asks again on the same pass instead of waiting out the host's join cooldown.
